    per project (1.4), payable annually within thirty (30) days of the end
    of each calendar year in which the Commercial Use occurred, together
    with a statement of Net Revenue for that period. Terms for new or
    multi-year engagements may be agreed in writing before signing.

3.3 No implied licence. Using the Software commercially without an executed
    Commercial License and payment of the royalty is a material breach of
